WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.100
Yarmouk University: your internship, from application to completion.

00:04.100 --> 00:08.200
Discover opportunities for your college and major.

00:08.200 --> 00:12.300
Apply. The company decides; you confirm one accepted offer.

00:12.300 --> 00:16.400
Train through assigned work, feedback and academically verified hours.

00:16.400 --> 00:21.000
Complete the requirements. Your coordinator approves completion and releases your certificate.
